WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200
Welcome to Career Direction & Action Toolkit. I’m

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:06.080
Brian Kennedy Jr. Your goal is a role

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:10.400
comparison and evidence-backed application plan. Choose two roles

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:13.360
and find one actual responsibility you can compare.

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:16.400
Keep your work private, record what you tried,

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:19.280
and set a review date. No job, interview,

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:21.680
salary or promotion is guaranteed.
